1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,700
And concentric, where one tissue surrounds the other.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:10,338
Amphivasal: xylem surrounds phloem, as in Dracaena and Yucca.

3
00:00:10,338 --> 00:00:14,765
Amphicribral: phloem surrounds xylem, as in ferns.

4
00:00:14,765 --> 00:00:19,674
Finally, open means a cambium is present, closed means none.

